  "securityRationales": [
    "Allowlist-only: an absent property, function, keyword, unit, or color name is rejected rather than passed through.",
    "Allowed properties are limited to passive presentation; positioning, generated content, animation, transitions, filters, cursor URLs, browser extensions, and behavior or binding hooks are excluded.",
    "Only deterministic math and color functions, custom-property references, and url() are recognized; url() and URL-bearing properties remain separately classified and require URL-policy approval.",
    "Allowed units are lengths and angles needed by the allowed profiles; time, frequency, resolution, flex, and container-query units are excluded.",
    "Color names are standard named sRGB constants plus transparent and currentcolor; system and deprecated color keywords are excluded.",
    "All lookup inputs are ASCII-lowercase, ordinally sorted by the generator, and pinned by checksum for reviewable deterministic updates."
  ],
